        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "<html><body><h2>Hi {{ $json.first_name }},</h2><p style=\"color: green; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Great news! Interest rates have decreased.</strong></p><p>Your previous rate was <strong>{{ $json.original_rate }}%</strong>, and you may now qualify for <strong>{{ $json.current_rate }}%</strong>!</p><p>This could save you <strong>${{ $json.monthly_savings }}/month</strong> - that's <strong>${{ $json.yearly_savings }}/year</strong>!</p><p style=\"background-color: #f0f8ff; padding: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #007bff;\">Lock in this rate before it changes. Rates can fluctuate daily.</p><p><a href=\"{{ $env.SUBDOMAIN_NYRA }}/apply\" style=\"background-color: #28a745; color: white; padding: 12px 30px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block; font-weight: bold;\">Lock In Your New Rate</a></p><p>Best regards,<br>The RateHunter Team</p></body></html>"
