        "fromEmail": "={{ $env.SMTP_FROM_EMAIL }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "subject": "Final Check-In: We're Here When You're Ready",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "<html><body><h2>Hi {{ $json.first_name }},</h2><p>It's been 45 days since we generated your mortgage quote. We understand that buying a home is a big decision, and we're here whenever you're ready.</p><p><strong>Your Quote Summary:</strong></p><ul><li>Original Rate: {{ $json.interest_rate }}%</li><li>Monthly Payment: ${{ $json.monthly_payment }}</li><li>Quote Expires: {{ $json.expires_at }}</li></ul><p>If your situation has changed or you're ready to move forward, we're just a call or click away:</p><ul><li>📞 Call us: {{ $env.TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER }}</li><li>✉️ Reply to this email</li><li>🌐 Visit: {{ $env.SUBDOMAIN_NYRA }}</li></ul><p>We'll keep your information on file for 90 days. After that, you're welcome to request a new quote anytime.</p><p>Thank you for considering RateHunter!</p><p>Best regards,<br>The RateHunter Team</p></body></html>"
      },
